        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;The house seemed empty. Now the only goal is to get out alive.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Story:</strong></i><br>The protagonist came for easy loot — but found a silence that seems to watch his every step.<br>Each room holds someone else’s pain, forgotten toys, and letters no one was meant to read…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Average playtime: <strong>30–40 minutes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Key Features:</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric Christmas-themed horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An emotional, engaging story revealed through notes and the character’s thoughts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumpscares and chilling moments that will make you hold your breath.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;The house seemed empty. Now the only goal is to get out alive.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Story:</strong></i><br>The protagonist came for easy loot — but found a silence that seems to watch his every step.<br>Each room holds someone else’s pain, forgotten toys, and letters no one was meant to read…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Average playtime: <strong>30–40 minutes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Key Features:</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric Christmas-themed horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An emotional, engaging story revealed through notes and the character’s thoughts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumpscares and chilling moments that will make you hold your breath.</p></li></ul>",
